   "body_excerpt": "`eth_call`, `eth_estimateGas`, and `eth_createAccessList` discard `frames` and `signatures` because [`TransactionArgs`](https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/blob/5fa696822d94d70263360001a4083eb861fd1e50/internal/ethapi/transaction_args.go#L42-L73) does not include them.

Example for a funded sender on a frame-enabled chain:

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1,
  "method": "eth_estimateGas",
  "params": [{
    "type": "0x6",
    "from": "0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111",
    "frames": [
      { "mode": "0x1", "flags": "0x3", "stateGas": "0x0" },
      { "mode": "0x2", "stateGas": "0x0" }
    ],
    "signatures": [{ "scheme": "0x1", "signature": null }]
  }, "latest"]
}
```

Support the frame requests proposed in https://github.com/ethereum/execution-apis/pull/907:

- Execute frames for calls, estimates, and access-list generation.
- Determine omitted gas limits while preservin [... omitted end of long line]

